  "verseCount": 36,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "1",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "JDG 1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "1",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Käp thuɔk duëël Juda kɛnɛ thok duëël Cim-on kɛ Ä-do-ni-bɛ-dhɛk",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 1:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛ kɔr li̱eth Jɔ-cua cu ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl Kuoth Nhial thiec i̱, “Ɛŋa mi bi wä nhiam ɔ kɛ nhiam kä ji̱ Kɛ-naan, mi bi ko̱r wä tɛr kɛ kui̱da?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.1.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.1.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 1:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cu Kuoth Nhial kɛ jiök i̱, “Bi thok duëël Juda wä. Nɛn ɛ jɛ, thok duëël ɣän cä mun ɛmɔ ka̱m kɛ.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.1.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.1.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 1:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cu thuk duëël Juda dämani ni thok duëël Cim-on jiök i̱, “Bia wanɛ wi̱c in ca ka̱m kɔ, banɛ wä kɛɛl bä wi̱c in ca ka̱m yɛ.” Inɔ cu ji̱ Cim-on wä kɛɛl kɛ kɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.1.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.1.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 1:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ɛ jɛn cu thok duëël Juda wä. Kä cu Kuoth Nhial kɛ ka̱m juc ji̱ Kɛ-naan kɛnɛ ji̱ Pɛ-rii-dhi. Cukɛ bathdɔɔri wäl joc kä Bɛ-dhɛk. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.1.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.1.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 1:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cukɛ ben kä Ä-do-ni-bɛ-dhɛk kä Bɛ-dhɛk, kä cukɛ ben nyiëëny kɛ jɛ, kä cukɛ ji̱ Kɛ-naan kɛnɛ ji̱ Pɛ-rii-dhi joc. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.1.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.1.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 1:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cu Ä-do-ni-bɛ-dhɛk rɔ bar, duundɛ ɣöö cua guɔ̱ɔ̱r amäni mëë ca cop, cua yiat tetädɛ min di̱i̱t kɛnɛ yiat cio̱kädɛ min di̱i̱t ŋot. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.1.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.1.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 1:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cuɛ wee, “Kua̱r ti jiɛn bärɔw ti cä yiɛt tetnikiɛn kɛnɛ yiɛt ciöknikiɛn tin di̱t ŋuɔ̱k, la kɛn duɔɔth a kueeny piny gua̱a̱th mi̱ethdä. Ce̱tnikɛ mëë la la̱tdä, ɛ jɛn ci Kuoth ɛ luɔ̱cä mɔ.” Cukɛ jɛ nööŋ kä Jɛ-ru-tha-lɛm, kä cuɛ ben li̱w thi̱n.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.1.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.1.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Käp thuɔk duëël ji̱ Juda kɛ Jɛ-ru-tha-lɛm kɛnɛ Ɣɛb-ron",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 1:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.1.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.1.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 1:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cu ji̱ Juda nyiëëny kɛ ji̱ Jɛ-ru-tha-lɛm, kä cukɛ Jɛ-ru-tha-lɛm ka̱n, cukɛ ji̱ kɛ näk kä cua wec cua̱th kɛ mac. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.1.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.1.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 1:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛ kɔrɛ cu ji̱ Juda wä nyiëëny kɛ ji̱ Kɛ-naan tin cieŋ päämni kä Nɛ-gɛb, kɛnɛ tin cieŋ täpä. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.1.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.1.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 1:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cukɛ wä nyiëëny kɛ ji̱ Kɛ-naan ti ciaŋkɛ ni Ɣɛb-ron (ɛn ciöt Ɣɛb-ron ni wen cɔalɛ Kir-yath-ar-bä). Kä cukɛ ji̱ Ce-cay kɛnɛ ji̱ Ä-ɣi-man kɛ ji̱ Tɛ̈l-may joc.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.1.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.1.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Käp Ɔ-thi-nel kɛ Dɛ-bir",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 1:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.1.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.1.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 1:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ɛn wi̱ni cukɛ wä muun ji̱ Dɛ-bir. Ɛn ciöt ni Dɛ-bir ni wal ɛ Kir-yath-the-pɛr. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.1.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.1.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 1:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Ka-leb wee, “Ram ɔ bi Kir-yath-the-pɛr ma̱k ɔ kä bɛ jɛ ka̱n, bä jɛ ka̱m nyaadä ni Ak-thaa ala ciekdɛ.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.1.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.1.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 1:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cu Ɔ-thi-nel gat Kɛ-nadh, gat däman Ka-leb in tɔt wec ɛ mɔ ka̱n. Kä cu Ka-leb ɛ ka̱m nyaadɛ ni Ak-thaa ala ciekdɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.1.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.1.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 1:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä mëë ci Ak-thaa ben cieŋ cuɛ cɔwdɛ kok i̱ thiec gua̱a̱r kɛ kak. Kä cuɛ käny piny jɔɔk muɔ̱lɛ, kä cu Ka-leb ɛ thiec i̱, “Ɛŋu nhɔki mɔ?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.1.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.1.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 1:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cuɛ jɛ jiök i̱, “Mocä kɛ muc. Min ci ɣä ka̱m mun Nɛ-gɛb, mocä kɛ waŋ pi̱i̱ni bä.” Cu Ka-leb ɛ ka̱m waŋ pi̱i̱ni min te dho̱nyä kɛnɛ waŋ pi̱i̱ni min te täpä.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.1.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.1.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Käp ji̱ Juda Kɛnɛ ji̱ Ben-ya-min kɛ wi̱i̱",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 1:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.1.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.1.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 1:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ɛ jɛn cu kuay gua̱nthu Muthɛ ni Kɛɛn, wä kɛɛl kɛ ji̱ Juda jiɛnkɛ kä Jɛ-ri-ko mun nööri wäkɛ därdɔaar Juda kä Nɛ-gɛb thie̱e̱kä Ä-rad. Cukɛ wä cieŋ ɛn wi̱ni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.1.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.1.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 1:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cu ji̱ Juda wä kɛɛl kɛ dämani ni ji̱ Cim-on, kä cukɛ ji̱ Kɛ-naan joc tin cieŋ kä Dhɛ-path, kä cukɛ jɛ da̱k ni piny. Ɛn wec cɔal ciötdɛ i̱ Ɣɔr-ma. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.1.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.1.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 1:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cu ji̱ Juda Gadha ka̱n bä nikɛ wi̱i̱kɛ kɛɛl, kɛ Ac-kɛ-lon nikɛ wi̱i̱kɛ kɛnɛ Ɛk-ron kɛ wi̱i̱kɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.1.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.1.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 1:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ɛn wa̱nɔ te Kuoth Nhial kɛɛl kɛ ji̱ Juda, kä cukɛ wi̱i̱ päämni käp, duundɛ ɣöö /kenkɛ wi̱i̱ tin te mädä luäŋ kɛ joc raar, kɛ ɣöö täkɛ thurbiɛɛli ko̱o̱r. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.1.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.1.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 1:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä Ɣɛb-ron ca ka̱m Ka-leb, ce̱tnikɛ ruac Muthɛ. Kä cuɛ kuay Ä-nak da̱ŋ diɔ̱k juɔc raar thi̱n. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.1.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.1.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 1:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä /ken ji̱ Ben-ya-min ji̱ Yɛ-buth tin cieŋ kä Kɛ-naan juɔc raar. Inɔ Cu ji̱ Yɛ-buth cu cieŋ kä Kɛ-naan kɛɛl kɛ ji̱ Ben-ya-min amäni walɛ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.1.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.1.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Käp Ɛ-pa-rim kɛnɛ Ma-na-thɛ kɛ Beth-ɛl",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 1:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.1.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.1.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 1:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cu ji̱ Ɛ-pa-rim kɛnɛ ji̱ Ma-na-thɛ wä nyiëëny kɛ ji̱ wec Beth-ɛl. Kä te Kuoth Nhial kɛɛl kɛ kɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.1.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.1.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 1:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cu ji̱ Ɛ-pa-rim kɛnɛ ji̱ Ma-na-thɛ li̱eem jäk kä Beth-ɛl. (Ciöt wec ɛmɔ ni wal cɔalɛ Luudh.) ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.1.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.1.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 1:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cu li̱eem raan nɛn bëë wi̱c, cukɛ jɛ jiök i̱, “Nyuth ni kɔ duɔ̱ɔ̱p wec, bakɔ ji̱ la̱t agɔaa.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.1.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.1.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 1:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cuɛ kɛ nyuɔ̱th duɔ̱p wec. Kä cukɛ ji̱ wec diaal näk, duundɛ ɣöö cukɛ wut ɛmɔ pa̱l wä kɛnɛ ji̱ dhɔaarɛ diaal. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.1.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.1.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 1:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cuɛ wä muun ji̱ ɣɛ̈th kä cu kɛ rɛk la̱t, mi cua ciötdɛ cɔl i̱ Luudh. Cuɛ cua̱ ciötdɛ amäni walɛ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.1.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.1.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Nɛy tëë /ka̱n juɔc raar ɛ ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 1:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.1.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.1.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 1:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "/Ken ji̱ Ma-na-thɛ nɛy tin cieŋ kä Beth-can kɛnɛ wi̱i̱kɛ, kɛ Ta-nak kɛ wi̱i̱kɛ, kɛ Dor kɛ wi̱i̱kɛ, kɛnɛ Yib-lɛ-am kɛ wi̱i̱kɛ, kɛ Mɛ-gi-do kɛ wi̱i̱kɛ. Kɛn wi̱i̱ tɔ̱tɔ̱ cu ji̱ Kɛ-naan ŋot kɛ ciaŋ thi̱n. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.1.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.1.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 1:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mëë ci ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl buɔ̱m, cu kɛ ji̱ Kɛ-naan kuɔ̱k ɣöö bakɛ lät ikä, duundɛ ɣöö /ka̱n kɛ juɔc raar kɛn diaal.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.1.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.1.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 1:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.1.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.1.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 1:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä /ken ji̱ Ɛ-pa-rim ji̱ Kɛ-naan tin cieŋ kä Gɛ-dhɛr juɔc raar. Cieŋ kɛ thi̱n kɛɛl kɛ kɛ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.1.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.1.29"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Käp wi̱i̱ni ji̱ Gɛ̈-lɛ-li",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 1:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.1.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.1.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 1:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "/Ken ji̱ Dhɛ-bu-lun Ji̱ Kith-ron kɛnɛ ji̱ Naa-lol juɔc raar rɛy wec. Cu ji̱ Kɛ-naan cieŋ rɛydiɛn, kä cukɛ kɛ jak kä la̱a̱tkiɛn.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.1.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.1.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 1:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.1.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.1.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 1:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä /ken ji̱ A-cɛr ji̱ Ak-ko kɛnɛ ji̱ Dhi-don, kɛ ji̱ A̱-lab, kɛnɛ ji̱ Ak-dhib, kɛ ji̱ Ä-pik, kɛ ji̱ Ɣɛl-ba, kɛ ji̱ Rɛ-ɣob juɔc raar.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.1.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.1.31"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 1:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.1.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.1.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 1:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inɔ cu ji̱ A-cɛr cieŋ rɛy ji̱ Kɛ-naan tin ciaŋkɛ wec. Kɛ ɣöö /ken kɛn kɛ juɔc raar. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.1.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.1.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 1:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä /ken ji̱ Nap-ta-li ji̱ Beth-cɛ-mɛc kɛnɛ ji̱ Beth-ä-nath juɔc raar, cu cieŋ nikɛn rɛy ji̱ Kɛ-naan tin ciaŋkɛ wec. Kä cukɛ kɛ kuɔ̱k la̱t kɛ kui̱diɛn.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.1.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.1.33"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 1:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.1.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.1.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 1:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu ji̱ Ɛ-mor ji̱ Daan kuɔ̱k wi̱i̱ tin te päämni, pën kɛn kɛ ben wi̱i̱ni tin te lɛɛrä. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.1.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.1.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 1:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cu ji̱ Ɛ-mor ŋot kɛ ciaaŋ kä A-ya-lon kɛnɛ Pääm Ɣɛ-rɛth, kɛ Cɛ̈ɛ̈l-bim, ɛ ni ɣöö cu ji̱ Ɛ-pa-rim kɛnɛ Ma-na-thɛ kɛ jak kä kuaanykiɛn ti la̱t kɛ kɛ ikä. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.1.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.1.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 1:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cu key ji̱ Ɛ-mor a Ak-ra-bim amäni Thɛlɛ̈ a wä nhiam.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.1.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.1.36"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
